title: Backport OriginCaller codec fix to v1.10
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Exclude the uninhabitable OriginCaller::Void variant from SCALE encoding
      and metadata so runtimes compile with SCALE's duplicate-index checks.
      Valid origin indices and encodings are unchanged; no migration is needed.
crates:
  - name: frame-support-procedural
    bump: patch
